{"ref":"BDB, מַתָּן²","hw":"מַתָּן²","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַתָּן</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.16\">Pr 18:16</a></sup> <strong>coll. gift(s)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:12\" href=\"/Genesis.34.12\">Gn 34:12</a> + 2 times; cstr. <em>id.</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.16\">Pr 18:16</a> (v. Baer<sup> ad loc.</sup> Ges<sup>§ 92 g</sup> Kö<sup>ii 1, 98</sup>); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַתָּנָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:11\" href=\"/Numbers.18.11\">Nu 18:11</a>;—marriage-<em>gifts</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:12\" href=\"/Genesis.34.12\">Gn 34:12</a> (J; + <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹהַר</span>); <em>offerings</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:11\" href=\"/Numbers.18.11\">Nu 18:11</a> (P; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּרוּמַת מ׳</span>); elsewhere gen., <em>gifts, presents</em>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.16\">Pr 18:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.14\">21:14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁחַד</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ מַתָּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.6\">19:6</a> = <em>a giver of gifts</em>.","next":"BDB, מַתָּן³","prev":"BDB, נְתַנְיָ֫הוּ"}